('u5_42_equipment_5_gap_3','vocab_equipment_5','u5_42_equipment_5','equipment_5_1','gap_fill','Hiring specialist equipment is cheaper than buying it, especially if you only go skiing once a year.','equipment','["equipment"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
