('u5_47_evaluate_5_meaning','vocab_evaluate_5','u5_47_evaluate_5','evaluate_5_1','meaning_context','Tour operators evaluate each new route by studying the number of bookings and the comments of customers.',null,'["weigh up"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
