('u5_47_evaluate_5_production','vocab_evaluate_5','u5_47_evaluate_5','evaluate_5_1','production_context','Researchers measure the success of each new tourist project by using visitor numbers and surveys.','measure the success of','["evaluate"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
