('u5_49_safety_regulations_production','vocab_safety_regulations','u5_49_safety_regulations','safety_regulations_1','production_context','Everyone on the site has to follow the rules that protect people from harm, including the wearing of helmets.','rules that protect people from harm','["safety regulations"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_49_safety_regulations_gap_1','vocab_safety_regulations','u5_49_safety_regulations','safety_regulations_1','gap_fill','Cable cars must pass regular inspections under strict safety regulations before they carry passengers.','safety regulations','["safety regulations"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_49_safety_regulations_gap_2','vocab_safety_regulations','u5_49_safety_regulations','safety_regulations_1','gap_fill','Because the company ignored safety regulations, the authorities closed the zip-line park for a month.','safety regulations','["safety regulations"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_49_safety_regulations_gap_3','vocab_safety_regulations','u5_49_safety_regulations','safety_regulations_1','gap_fill','In most countries, boats that carry passengers must follow safety regulations, such as carrying enough life jackets for everybody.','safety regulations','["safety regulations"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
('u5_50_excursion_meaning','vocab_excursion','u5_50_excursion','excursion_1','meaning_context','The highlight of the language course was the excursion to the castle, which took the whole of Saturday.',null,'["day trip"]'::jsonb,null,'live'),
